  "body": "In the [attribute setter](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-attribute-setter) algorithm, |id| is declared inside |steps|, but used outside it:\n\n> 1. Let |steps| be the following series of steps:\n>     1. Let |V| be undefined.\n>     1. If any arguments were passed, then set |V| to the value of the first argument passed.\n>     1. Let |id| be |attribute|'s identifier.\n>     1. …\n> 1. Let |name| be the string \"`set `\" prepended to |id|.\n> 1. Let |F| be CreateBuiltinFunction(|steps|, 1, |name|, « », |realm|).\n\nSince [variables are block scoped](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#variables), |id| is not in scope where |name| is computed.\n\nThis PR uses |attribute|'s identifier directly, the same way the [attribute getter](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-attribute-getter) does:\n\n> 1. Let |name| be the string \"`set `\" prepended to |attribute|'s identifier.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/webidl/1661.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2026, 7:11 AM UTC (3146e72)\">Preview</a> | <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/webidl/1661/7b9f91b...3146e72.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 4, 2026, 7:11 AM UTC (3146e72)\">Diff</a>",
